  - landslide-precursor
abstract: >
  Dual-polarization Sentinel-1 analysis testing for a repeatable radar
  precursor signal ahead of slope failures at Langtang Lirung, Nepal. The
  cross-polarization ratio shows a matching pre-failure dip ahead of both
  the 2025 and 2026 events, localized to the failure zone rather than the
  surrounding region.
